  1. The effects of resistance training with or without peanut protein supplementation on skeletal muscle and strength adaptations in older individuals
     Donald A. Lamb, Johnathon H. Moore, Morgan A. Smith, Christopher G. Vann, Shelby C. Osburn, Bradley ...
     PMC7734909 · Journal of the International Society of Sports Nutrition · 2020-12-14
     https://doi.org/10.1186/s12970-020-00397-y
     "This study investigated the effects of resistance training with or without peanut protein supplementation on muscle and strength in older adults. Peanut protein supplementation showed some benefits in muscle thickness and strength, but not overall body composition or acute muscle protein synthesis."

